      "completeness": 5,
      "style_fit": 5
    },
    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Plated gauntlet with four articulated-looking finger plates, a thumb plate, a laminated back-of-hand defence with brass edges and a star punch, a tan leather glove, and a flared cuff with a buckled strap. The bottom view confirms the cuff is genuinely hollow with a modelled interior, so a hand can be placed inside. Free-standing, no stand. Unrigged.",
    "limitations": [
      "Stylised Cozy-kit palette rather than photoreal materials.",
      "The finger plates are fused and will not curl with a hand rig without separation.",
      "Modelled as a right hand only; mirror it for the left."
    ],
